## Episodic Retention Analysis ##

## This analysis measures audience retention across episodes of a serialized program.
## It maps playback activity to subscriptions, identifies how many unique episodes each subscriber watched, and builds a distribution of episode completion depth across the audience.
## The resulting output shows both episode-viewing retention rates, helping evaluate audience drop-off throughout a series.

with android_2 as (
    select
        convert_timezone('utc', 'america/chicago', timestamp::timestamp_ntz) as ts
      , date(ts) as dt
      , program as p
      , title as t
      , case
            when user_id ilike '%legacy%' then trim(split(user_id, 'legacy-')[1], '""')
            else user_id
        end as user_id
      , 1 as plays
    from android.playbacks
    where dt >= '2025-01-01'
        and dt < current_date()
)

